1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,960
Google Assistant just got an end date.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:04,620
On your Nest speaker.

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,120
Wait, really?

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,280
Yep.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,000
Google says it's retiring Assistant on every

6
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,060
speaker and smart display.

7
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,240
The date?

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,320
August second, twenty twenty-seven.

9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,620
Here's what replaces it.

10
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,140
Gemini for Home.

11
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:24,700
You just talk normally, no special commands.

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,660
Google says the upgrade's free, and every

13
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,400
device supported today keeps working.

14
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,180
Oh, and the Nest app?

15
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:36,880
It shuts down on January twenty-fifth.

16
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,780
Here's the catch.

17
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,680
Once you switch, you can't switch back.

18
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,980
The chatty Gemini Live needs a ten-dollar

19
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,460
monthly plan.

20
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,620
And the original Google Home doesn't get

21
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,320
it at all.

22
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:50,640
By our score?

23
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,840
Sixty out of a hundred.

24
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:54,660
Spec!

25
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,580
If you want smarter answers.

26
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:59,440
Not if you loved simple commands.

27
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:00,660
Be honest.

28
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:03,340
Would you keep the old Assistant if

29
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:03,940
you could?
